<label class="small"><input type="checkbox" id="afollow" data-cact="afollow" <%~ it.armada2Follow %>> Follow the Leader (V formation + jumps)</label><div class="dim small">JOIN does not enable Follow: opt in here. Both ships must be in flight in the same system. Your ship needs its own jump fuel and route access. Manual flight or weapons input turns Follow off. Combat Assist takes priority. Re-enable after reconnecting or a leader change.</div>